  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000r30q](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000r30q) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 226.917 depth occurred on Aug 22 2025 15km E of Forari. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -17.6647 longitude 168.6688. It impacted 96999 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
